<section class="w-full" id="faq"><div class="relative isolate"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-5 px-5 pt-24 pb-12 text-center md:border-border/50 md:border-x"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-foreground/10 p-3 text-foreground"><svg class="lucide lucide-book-open size-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg></span><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4"><h2 class="max-w-2xl text-balance font-medium font-sans text-2xl text-foreground leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="max-w-xl text-center text-muted-foreground text-sm">Still have questions? Email us at<!-- --> <a class="text-muted-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-brand-foreground-2" href="#">support@flightcast.com</a></p></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-xl"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-search pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-3 size-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input aria-label="Search frequently asked questions" autocomplete="off" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs outline-none transition-[color,box-shadow] selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:font-medium file:text-foreground file:text-sm placeholder:text-muted-foreground disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm dark:bg-input/30 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 !bg-card h-11 pr-3 pl-10 md:h-10" data-slot="input" placeholder="Search questions and answers…" spellcheck="false" type="search" value=""/></div></div><div class="border-border/50 border-t md:[mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,transparent_0%,black_25%,black_75%,transparent_100%)]"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 hidden h-[60%] lg:block"><div class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full overflow-hidden text-foreground/15 dark:text-foreground/5" style="--scales-size:16px;--scales-angle:315deg"><div class="h-full w-full bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(var(--scales-angle),currentColor_0,currentColor_1px,transparent_0,transparent_50%)]" style="background-size:var(--scales-size) var(--scales-size)"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background to-transparent"></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl bg-background md:border-border/50 md:border-x"><div class="relative bg-border/25" style="padding:6px"><div class="relative rounded-lg bg-card shadow-sm overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 bottom-0 left-0 z-10 h-[240px] bg-gradient-to-t from-card to-transparent"></div><div class="px-6 py-12 overflow-hidden" style="height:590px;min-height:590px"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl" style="border-radius:10px"><div class="pr-1"><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl">Publishing &amp; Distribution</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Where does Flightcast post video vs. audio?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Flightcast supports video to YouTube; video or audio to Spotify, Apple Podcasts, and all RSS-based platforms. You can customize this to your liking. We support pretty much every combination of video/audio you'd want.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Will publishing through Flightcast affect my YouTube distribution?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Flightcast publishes directly to your connected YouTube channel through YouTube's official API. Your video remains available in YouTube Studio and is eligible for YouTube's standard distribution systems and features. Flightcast does not control YouTube's or any other platform's recommendations or algorithms.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How does Flightcast publish episodes?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Flightcast publishes through official channels via partnerships with Google, Spotify, and other platforms. Each version is sent directly to the platforms you enable.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_546i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_146i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I upload some episodes to JUST YouTube? Just RSS?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_146i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_546i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes, every platform is optional. You can turn Youtube/Spotify/RSS on/off as you prefer.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I set different thumbnails, tags, playlists, or chapters for YouTube from inside Flightcast?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yep! We can do pretty much everything except for A/B tests directly through Flightcast. For A/B testing thumbnails/titles, after scheduling on Flightcast, you can set up the A/B test on YouTube.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast support episode trailers, bonuses, and seasons/numbering?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes, we support all standard RSS-based podcasting</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I bulk upload or queue multiple episodes at once?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5s6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">You can have as many draft episodes as you want, and schedule as many as you want ahead of time. We don't yet have any big "bulk uploads", though. If you're coming in with a YouTube channel however, you can use our YouTube → Podcast Sync feature to upload your entire back catalog to Spotify+Audio Platforms.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_646i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_246i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast support private/paid/unlisted feeds?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_246i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_646i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No. At the moment, Flightcast supports only public RSS feeds.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I bring my own domain or custom subdomain for the RSS feed?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6c6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No. At the moment, Flightcast supports only flightcast.com rss feeds.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I manage multiple shows from one account and switch between them easily?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6k6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yep! However, be aware that Flightcast charges per podcast, so additional shows will incur additional cost.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Video-First Workflow &amp; AI</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What video formats, resolutions, and frame rates does Flightcast accept?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Any and all. We retain your raw video, and upload that directly to YouTube and Spotify.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can Flightcast extract audio automatically from my uploaded video?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast creates audio files from all videos uploaded to the platform.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast create captions/subtitles from transcripts (SRT/VTT)?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes, Flightcast automatically transcribes all files uploaded to the platform. These transcripts are used to power our AI features, and are available in the Transcript tab on any episode.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_54ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_14ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast generate AI titles / AI Descriptions / AI Chapters / AI show notes?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_14ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_54ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast learns from your past titles/descriptions/chapters, combines that with your new episode's transcript, and uses that to generate new titles/chapters that sounds like you.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can Flightcast auto-generate chapters?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do Flightcast AI Clips go to all platforms? Just some?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">At the moment, Flightcast clips publish only to YouTube, only to a separate channel.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What does Flightcast use to generate AI Clips?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5sai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Flightcast works with OpusClip to generate AI Clips, then uses our own system to upload and track them.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_64ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_24ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I upload custom thumbnails from Flightcast?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_24ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_64ai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast can post thumbnails to both YouTube and Spotify</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I A/B Test Thumbnails directly from Flightcast?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6cai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No. But you can schedule the episode to YouTube through Flightcast, then add the A/B test after on YouTube studio. We're working on this.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you store my data to train AI?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6kai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No. we only use your data for answers from your own AI. We don't do any global training or cross-show training. Your data is yours.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Scheduling &amp; Release Control</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1cei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I schedule episodes ahead of time?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1cei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! You can even schedule different platforms for different times - so YouTube can go out at 6am and Spotify can go out at 8am for the same episode.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1kei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What time zone does Flightcast schedule in?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1kei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">We use your local timezone when scheduling - this will always be displayed next to the calendar, so even if you travel, you'll always know when you're uploading.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1sei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_sei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do I have to upload both video and audio?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1sei9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No. Flightcast will take the mp3 from your video file and distribute that to audio platforms. If you want, you can upload one video file and just hit publish, and it'll go everywhere in the right formats.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Analytics &amp; Reporting</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Where does Flightcast get its data?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Everywhere we can. We integrate with a ton of APIs, calculate our own stats over RSS, and much much more.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How does Flightcast get YouTube data?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">We use a combination of the YouTube API, and our chrome extension.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What data does Flightcast have?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">A lot. Views, Downloads, and Streams are the main 3 metrics. Then new &amp; returning viewers &amp; listeners, CTR, AVD, and pretty much everything else you can think of. Some stats we even calculate custom.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_54ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_14ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast show retention from YouTube and Spotify?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_14ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_54ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast pulls retention data from both YouTube and Spotify and overlays them so you can analyze the differences easily.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How long does Flightcast store data?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5cii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Forever, unless you want us to delete it.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Are analytics exportable (CSV) and available via API?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5kii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">CSV, Yes. API, no, not yet. We have plans for this. If you want a certain graph to add a CSV export, please put in a feature request, and we can add that quickly!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Are download counts IAB-compliant?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5sii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">We follow the IAB Podcast Measurement Technical Guidelines, but are not formally IAB-certified. A public summary of how we count downloads and unique listeners is at /measurement-methodology. Email support@flightcast.com to request the full Document of Methodology PDF.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_64ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_24ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What's your data policy?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_24ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_64ii9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Your data is yours. Do what you want with it, we'll delete it if you ask. We won't share it with anyone. Same with your content, we take the absolute minimum permissions needed to run the platform, both technically and legally.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Monetization &amp; Ads</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast support dynamic ad insertion (pre/mid/post-roll)?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast supports dynamic host-read ads as well as programmatic ad insertion through our ad partners.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I run my own host-read ads through Flightcast?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! Flightcast supports dynamic host-read ads with impression targets.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_4smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast include an ads marketplace that advertisers can sell into?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_4smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Not directly, no. We have programmatic ads partners, but Flightcast does not directly have a portal for advertisers to place ads on Flightcast-specific shows.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_54mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_14mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you support geo-targeting (e.g., UK-only campaign) and frequency caps for ads?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_14mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_54mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes and yes.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I limit ads to certain episodes or exclude sensitive episodes?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Not yet, but we're working on this and expect to launch it before the end of October.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I cross-promote shows in Flightcast with feed drops?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No, we don't yet support feed drops.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_5smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How are CPMs determined and how is revenue shared?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_5smi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">For Flightcast Ads, CPMs are determined by our ad partners. You keep 90% of net revenue on programmatic demand we source, and we keep 10% as a platform fee. Spotify payouts, your own direct campaigns, and your own VAST tags are fee-free — we pass those along in full.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_64mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_24mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">What payout methods are supported and what's the schedule?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_24mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_64mi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">We pay out as often as we get paid, for all ads</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Is there a minimum payout threshold?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6cmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes, $100 USD.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_6kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I mix programmatic and host-read ads in the same show?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_6kmi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yep! Mix and match whatever you want. We put programmatic at the bottom of the list by default, so host-read will be prioritized over programmatic.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Migration &amp; Setup</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can Flightcast import my back catalog from an existing RSS feed?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yep! We can import all your audio in seconds.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2kqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do I have to resubmit my show to every platform like Apple Podcasts?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2kqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Nope! Just setup a 301 redirect on your old platform (we will guide you through this) and all the platforms will automatically pick up that you're using Flightcast now!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2sqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_sqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How do I update Apple Podcasts and Spotify to recognize my new feed (or is it automatic)?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2sqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">It's automatic! Once you redirect your show to Flightcast, you won't have to</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_34qi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_14qi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Will my Apple Podcasts ratings/reviews and Spotify followers be preserved?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_14qi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_34qi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_3cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I import historical analytics from my previous host?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_3cqi9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! We can import historical analytics from most major podcast hosts, but not all. Drop your feed into our setup and we'll tell you if we can keep your data.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Team, Roles &amp; Network Management</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2cui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_cui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I add team members with granular permissions (publish vs analytics-only)?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_cui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2cui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">For now, we have three roles: Admin, manager, viewer. We are working on more granularity!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2kui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_kui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you support drafts / scheduling?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_kui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2kui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! You can make drafts in Flightcast, upload everything,</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2sui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_sui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I manage multiple shows with consolidated billing and shared assets?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_sui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2sui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">You can manage as many shows as you like on Flightcast. Each show maintains its own subscription that you can upgrade or downgrade at any time, and all are billed to the team each month. You can have some shows on basic plans, some on pro plans, etc.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_34ui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_14ui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you offer SSO/SAML or SCIM provisioning for larger teams?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_14ui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_34ui9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Content Management &amp; Media</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2d2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_d2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you normalize loudness (e.g., -16 LUFS for podcasts) automatically?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_d2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2d2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">We normalize your ads to be a standard loudness, but we don't currently adjust the volume of your podcast itself.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2l2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_l2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I replace a media file after publishing without breaking links?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_l2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2l2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes, for audio you can do this seamlessly. For video or audio on Spotify, you can do this seamlessly. For YouTube, you can upload a new video</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_2t2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_t2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you keep original versions of files?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_t2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2t2i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes! We encode different versions of files for delivery to RSS, but we always retain your originals, so you can redownload them at any time.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_352i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_152i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">How long do you store my files? Is storage truly unlimited?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_152i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_352i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">On regular plans, we have insanely high reasonable storage limits. Until you've passed 4 TB of files, you won't hear from us.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Integrations &amp; Extensibility</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1d6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_d6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Do you support Zapier/webhooks for custom workflows?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_d6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1d6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No, but we have plans to allow this in the future.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1l6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_l6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Can I connect cloud storage (Drive/Dropbox/S3) for ingest?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_l6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1l6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No, but we have plans to allow this in the future.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1t6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_t6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Is there a public API for publishing and analytics?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_t6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1t6i9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No, but we have plans to allow this in the future.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-left font-medium text-muted-foreground text-xl mt-8 pt-8">Player, Website &amp; Embeds</h3><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1dai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_dai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does Flightcast provide an embeddable player?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_dai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_1dai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"><div class="pb-5 pt-0 text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">No, for now we recommend using YouTube, Apple Podcasts, or Spotify embeds. We are working on this!</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/50" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-_R_1lai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left font-medium text-base leading-snug hover:no-underline data-[state=open]:text-foreground" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_lai9bv5ubsnq6lb_" type="button"><span class="text-pretty pr-2">Does flightcast support podcast websites or episode pages?</span><svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_